  </div>
</section>

<!-- INTRO SECTION -->
<section class="acdt-intro content-section" aria-labelledby="gmt-kst-intro-heading">
  <h2 id="gmt-kst-intro-heading" class="sr-only">About Greenwich Mean Time to Korea Standard Time Conversion</h2>
  <p>
    Welcome to our official <strong>GMT to KST Time Zone Converter</strong>. Converting time from Greenwich Mean Time (GMT, UTC+0) to Korea Standard Time (KST, UTC+9) requires adjusting your clock by <strong>exactly +9 hours</strong>. Korea Standard Time is the single uniform time zone governing the entire Republic of Korea, including capital city Seoul, industrial center Busan, tech hub Seongnam, and Jeju Island.
  </p>
  <p>
    Because South Korea does not observe Daylight Saving Time, KST remains fixed at UTC+9 throughout the entire year. Meanwhile, pure GMT serves as the international atomic baseline (UTC+0). When it is 8:00 AM GMT in London or Greenwich, it is 5:00 PM KST in Seoul on the same day. As the afternoon progresses in GMT, local time in Korea advances past midnight into the next calendar day.
  </p>
  <p>
    Coordinating schedules across a 9-hour difference requires strategic planning. Business teams in Europe and East Asia rely on the morning GMT window (8:00 AM to 10:00 AM GMT), which aligns with the end of the Korean working day (5:00 PM to 7:00 PM KST). This specialized utility offers real-time clocks, complete 24-hour conversion tables, interactive input calculators, and meeting planners tailored for global enterprises, esports fans, and transatlantic travelers.
  </p>
  <p>
    From Korean semiconductor manufacturing and automotive exports to worldwide K-Pop culture and tech infrastructure, maintaining precise timing between Europe and South Korea is vital. This guide delivers clear, error-free conversion tools backed by official IANA time zone data.
  </p>
</section>

<!-- INTERACTIVE CONVERTER & SVG HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="converter-section" aria-labelledby="converter-heading">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Interactive Timezone Utility</p>
    <h2 id="converter-heading">Convert GMT to Korea Standard Time</h2>
    <p>
      Use the dynamic converter below to calculate the exact Korea Standard Time for any GMT timestamp. Adjust dates and hours to see instant conversion results.
    </p>

    <!-- Custom Visual SVG: Royal Observatory Greenwich & N Seoul Tower -->
    <div class="custom-svg-container" style="margin-top: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel);">
